The source images retain CC BY-SA 3.0, including its commercial-use permissions. No NonCommercial restriction is added to the source photographs. Any adapted source material remains subject to its original ShareAlike requirements. Merely including these works in this collection does not change their individual licenses.

Photograph credit: the authors and contributors listed in sources.json and CITATIONS.bib. image_manifest.csv identifies the source dataset, building record, original file, license and checksum for every selected image. Images are selected and renamed for case-level organization; the release does not edit their pixels.

No endorsement by the source creators is implied. Original source labels are distinct from the SeisMLLM-generated assessment annotations. Other applicable rights are not waived.
